From 7e80c80f36dbb0bc7b1f648ec434bc833e80f74e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Deepak <deepak@optionsedgeflow.com>
Date: Fri, 12 Jun 2026 05:06:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] =?UTF-8?q?security:=20full=20audit=20fixes=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20auth,=20CORS,=20JWT=20dedup,=20cron=20secret,=20red?=
 =?UTF-8?q?is=20cache?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

P0 fixes:
- api/user/prefs.js: replace decodeJwt (no sig verify) with getAuth from _lib/auth
- api/brief.js: replace decodeJwt with getAuth on ticker and morning brief GET endpoints
- api/telegram.js: add CRON_SECRET auth gate; bot token never accepted from request body
- src/lib/adminBypass.js: create missing frontend module (was causing import error)
- src/lib/useSubscription.js: fix wrong URL /api/subscription -> /api/user/subscription

P1 fixes:
- All API files: restrict CORS Allow-Origin from * to optionsedgeflow.com
- api/alerts/send.js + trigger.js: remove CRON_SECRET from query param (was in logs)
- api/user/subscription.js + trades.js + checkout.js + portal.js + tradier.js:
  consolidate all duplicate verifyClerkJWT/getClerkId/b64d to shared getAuth

P2 fixes:
- api/brief.js: FMP key reads FMP_API_KEY env var with demo fallback
- api/brief.js: delete().neq('id',0) -> delete().lt('generated_at', cutoff)
- api/tradier.js: cacheSet uses POST pipeline instead of GET URL-encoding
- api/user/subscription.js: add 1hr grace period to expiry check
