From: Deepak <deepak@optionsedgeflow.com>
Date: Fri, 12 Jun 2026 05:16:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] =?UTF-8?q?fix:=20P2/P3=20audit=20items=20=E2=80=94=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?subscription=20gates,=20trade=20limits,=20brief=20polling,=20ti?=
 =?UTF-8?q?mezone?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

P2 fixes:
- api/alerts/send.js: subscription inner-join before sending alerts — free/inactive
  users no longer receive email or SMS notifications
- api/user/prefs.js: block free users from enabling email_alerts or sms_alerts;
  returns 402 if no active subscription
- api/user/trades.js: enforce 500-trade max per user (admins unlimited);
  returns 429 with clear message when limit reached

P3 fixes:
- src/Router.jsx: subscription status now refreshes on window focus event,
  catching mid-session expiry without requiring page reload
- src/components/MorningBrief.jsx:
  - load() converted to useCallback to fix stale closure in useEffect deps
  - isPreCronWindow cutoff corrected: 7:30 AM CT -> 9:30 AM CT
    (cron fires at 9 AM ET = 8 AM CT, was stopping poll 90min too early)
  - isTradingDay now uses America/New_York (NYSE timezone, not Chicago)
  - UI copy updated: '7 AM CT' -> '8 AM CT'
- api/_lib/marketCalendar.js: isTradingDay timezone America/Chicago -> New_York
  (holiday detection must use NYSE timezone to be correct)
---
 api/_lib/marketCalendar.js      |  2 +-
 api/alerts/send.js              |  6 ++++--
 api/user/prefs.js               | 15 +++++++++++++++
 api/user/trades.js              | 12 ++++++++++++
 src/Router.jsx                  | 27 +++++++++++++++------------
 src/components/MorningBrief.jsx | 25 +++++++++++++------------
 6 files changed, 60 insertions(+), 27 deletions(-)

